policy.py, trajectory.py, running_stats.py, model_versions.py retain upstream logic.
model.py extracts full-body model edits and finger token lists, removes native fallback/caching and MyoSuite texture lookup, and loads bundled assets. hf_io.py retains legacy cache lookup only.
Bundled model assets originate from musclemimic-models 1.0.6; model_versions.py identifies this bundled release without package lookup and applies the checkpoint-compatible 1.0.5 attribute values at build time.
No prosim runtime code is imported.

actor_torch.py and fullbody_obs_torch.py are ported from MyoSuite 3.0.0; local imports and rotation math replace mjlab dependencies.
